  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Hints: }:^{n-1} C_3+{ }^{n-1} C_4>{ }^n C_3 \\\\\n& \\qquad \\Rightarrow^n C_4>^n C_3 \\Rightarrow \\frac{n !}{4 !(n-4) !}>\\frac{n !}{3 !(n-3) !} \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{4}>\\frac{1}{(n-3)} \\Rightarrow n-3>4 \\Rightarrow n>7\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
